{"product_id":"dont-forget-tiggs","title":"Don't Forget Tiggs!","description":"\u003cp\u003eA rib-tickling story about a family that spends too much time rushing to remember anything importantMr. and Mrs. Hurry are always rushing about. They never stop! But that means they forget some rather important things—like eating . . . and shopping . . . and taking their son Harry to school! Thankfully, Tiggs the cat is around to remind them. But will anyone remember to give Tiggs his dinner?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Rosen\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781783442690\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898786472089,"sku":"17RE-49781783442690","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69184a8c086c6_Don_t_Forget_Tiggs.jpg?v=1763223120","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/dont-forget-tiggs","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}